{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Like a swine's snout</b> — for it brings it into mire and ruins it, and this is a proverb. So too beauty is like gold, and the foolish woman is like a swine, which has no understanding, and the beauty in her is ruined when she turns away from the quality of wisdom. And סרת is on the pattern of: ומגרת ביתה."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:11.594968504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}